          <div class="step-heading">Non-Parametric Vector Retrieval (FAISS) &amp; Automated 3-Tier Enforcement</div>
          <div class="step-tensor-sig">Inputs: Score S_t + Vector Distance d_kNN + Session Telemetry → Policy Execution</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-2col">
        <div class="content-box">
          <div class="block-label lbl-how">NON-PARAMETRIC k-NN RETRIEVAL (STEP 14)</div>
          <ul class="bullet-list">
            <li>The global vector $z \in \mathbb{R}^{256}$ is queried against an in-memory FAISS index containing verified human baselines and newly discovered zero-day spoof clusters.</li>
            <li>Calculates minimum cosine distance $d_{\text{kNN}}$. If $z$ falls within a zero-day cluster radius ($d_{\text{kNN}} < \tau$), an immediate spoof warning is raised even if the neural classifier is ambiguous.</li>
            <li><strong>Benefit:</strong> Instant protection against novel voice models without waiting weeks for model retraining.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="content-box">
          <div class="block-label lbl-why">MULTI-FACTOR TELEMETRY FUSION (STEP 15)</div>
          <ul class="bullet-list">
            <li>Acoustic scores are cross-verified with session metadata before triggering alerts:
              <br>• <strong>Carrier ANI Spoof Check:</strong> Validates caller ID against cellular SS7/STIR-SHAKEN headers.
              <br>• <strong>Network Type:</strong> Validates mobile cell tower routing vs. unverified SIP trunks.
              <br>• <strong>SIM Swap Recency:</strong> Flags if SIM was swapped in the last 72 hours.
              <br>• <strong>IVR Velocity:</strong> Detects automated voicebots traversing phone menus.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Triaging Tiers Table -->
      <div class="triaging-grid">
        <div class="t-box t-green">
          <div class="t-header" style="color:var(--c-green);">GREEN ZONE (S_t &lt; 0.30)</div>
          <p class="t-desc">
            <strong>Condition:</strong> Low acoustic risk and clean telephony.<br>
            <strong>Action:</strong> Silent pass. Green "Verified" badge on agent UI. 0% friction.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="t-box t-yellow">
          <div class="t-header" style="color:var(--c-amber);">YELLOW ZONE (0.30 ≤ S_t ≤ 0.80)</div>
          <p class="t-desc">
            <strong>Check 1 (Clean Telemetry):</strong> Suppress alert silently as room noise/codec artifact.<br>
            <strong>Check 2 (Ambiguous):</strong> Automated in-app FaceID/OTP push. 98% resolved in &lt; 3s.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="t-box t-red">
          <div class="t-header" style="color:var(--c-coral);">RED ZONE (S_t &gt; 0.80 / Trigger)</div>
          <p class="t-desc">
            <strong>Condition:</strong> High-confidence deepfake or instant override ($P_k > 0.88$).<br>
            <strong>Action:</strong> Lock wire/profile changes. Route to L2 Fraud Ops with forensic logs.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
