        <div class="branch-col col-amber">
          <span class="branch-tag tag-amber">STEP 18 · Vector Ingestion</span>
          <p style="font-size:12px; color:var(--text-body);">When a novel voice spoof vector is confirmed by fraud analysts or red-team scrapers, its 256-dimensional embedding is indexed into the FAISS vector database in real time for instant zero-latency protection.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="branch-col col-purple">
          <span class="branch-tag tag-purple">STEP 19 · EWC Retraining</span>
          <p style="font-size:12px; color:var(--text-body);">Retraining uses Elastic Weight Consolidation (EWC) to calculate Fisher Information Matrices, freezing weights critical to historical deepfakes while fine-tuning adapter plugins on new speech data.</p>
          <div class="math-block">L_{\text{total}} = L_{\text{new}} + \sum_i \frac{\lambda}{2} F_i (\theta_i - \theta_{i, \text{old}})^2</div>
        </div>
